message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CollocAgent: A Corpus-Grounded System for Auditable Collocation Feedback"
abstract: >-
  CollocAgent is a standalone system for collocation feedback in second-language
  academic writing. It separates diagnosis, corpus retrieval with candidate
  ranking, and explanation, and binds every reported statistic to a named corpus,
  a stated co-occurrence window, and a SHA-256 fingerprint of the indexed source
  files. When the corpus index provides no support for a recommendation, the
  system returns an explicit insufficient-evidence status instead of a number.
  The implementation uses only the Python standard library and runs from a
  command line, a local JSON API, and a browser client.
